  "description": "Paul can leap through time, and uses his ability to overcome life's crises and maintains a smooth life... But after being dumped by his lover, he opens his eyes the next morning to see a handsome man and absolutely no way to leave... He almost managed to escape by turning back time, but that handsome man is the boss of the company...?! \n\nCan Paul really change his fate? \n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
